Himalayas or the desert.

276
00:18:04,040 --> 00:18:06,437
If we ran into trouble,
we'd lose a lot of time.

277
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:08,108
There are too many dangers.

278
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:11,477
